Title: The Keeper's Log
Author: Cold Open tests

EXT. CLIFF PATH - DAWN

Gulls over the rocks.

TOMAS
She kept the light on. Always.

She climbs.

INT. LIGHTHOUSE - NIGHT #1#

*The lamp*

turns. Rain against the glass.

~A bell rings below.

MARA
(to herself)
Three ships tonight.

CUT TO:
